# The SDL_GPU backend's frame check on the HD path (ADR 0028, stage S9.5): terran01 with the profile's video options
# (auto: the HD art, lit, the smooth fog, the animated water) on the fixed clock. The game stands under its menu, the
# main thread stands while the loader reads the pages the frame asks for (hang), the pages go up, then the frame is
# shot. tools/ci.sh runs it with --gfx gl and --gfx gpu over Remastered's repack and tools/gfx_compare.py reports the
# frames' largest difference (the index path's frames, determinism.kps's, are compared byte for byte).
mission terran/terran01
clock fixed

wait game
wait frames 60
menu game
wait dialog gamemenu
hang 2
wait frames 60
log art art.scale art.lit art.fx hd.ui
shot menu
